<title>VENEZUELA: ADVISORY - Venezuelan banks and markets closed.</title>
<headline>ADVISORY - Venezuelan banks and markets closed.</headline>
<dateline>CARACAS 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Venezuela's banks and financial markets are closed Tuesday, June 24 for the Battle of Carabobo public holiday.</p>
<p>They will reopen on Wednesday, June 25.</p>
<p>((-- Caracas newsroom, 582 505 2600))</p>
</text>
